  <content>
  <section>
    <para>Use formula for the area of a triangle, \( A=\frac{1}{2}bh \), where \( b \) is the base of the triangle and \( h \) is the height of the triangle. Which equation would best be used to find the base of the triangle?</para>
  </section>
</content>
